# L §3.4 A price year with no index: "Read at a law date in Y it is the figure itself, in its declared type
# (money CUR for a money input). At any other date it is a hole: <x> is in Y prices; no index moves it to <d>
# (HOLE-PRICE)."
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2015-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "a source"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input old: money PLN prices 2015

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2015-01-01
  old = 500.00 PLN

ask q1: old law 2015-06-30
ask q2: old law 2026-06-30
=== expect
q1: 500.00 PLN
  law date 2015-06-30, cut 2026-01-01
q2: ?"old is in 2015 prices; no index moves it to 2026-06-30" (old)
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-01-01
